# --- Gate 1 additions (2026-07-23): local-only metadata that must never
# reach the remote. Face crops and review assets stay on this machine
# (privacy operations); import/verify state is bulky derived data,
# regenerable from the master + cloud. Curation CSVs stay tracked.
metadata/import/
metadata/verify/
metadata/audit/review-sheets/
metadata/identity-review/*
!metadata/identity-review/*.csv
# Claude Design session artifacts (external design session drops these in
